    <edge source="api" target="drugs and cosmetics rules 1945" id="0">
      <data key="d7">GOVERNED_BY</data>
      <data key="d8">11</data>
      <data key="d9">["Chunk 1: \"This Part applies to the manufacture of APIs for use in Finished Pharmaceutical Products (FPPs).\"", "(i) releasing or rejecting all APIs.", "Personnel shall avoid direct contact with intermediates or APIs.", "Buildings and facilities used in the manufacture of intermediates and APIs shall be located, designed and constructed to facilitate cleaning, maintenance and operations as appropriate to the type and stage of manufacture.", "All documents related to the manufacture of intermediates or APIs shall be prepared, reviewed, approved and distributed according to written procedures.", "Raw materials for manufacturing of intermediates and APIs shall be weighed", "blending of tailings (i.e., relatively small quantities of isolated material) from batches of the same intermediate or API to form a single batch.", "Batch production records shall be prepared for each intermediate and API", "Laboratory control records shall include complete data derived from all tests conducted to ensure compliance with established specifications and standards", "DOC: drugs_and_cosmetics_rules_1945_updated_2024.md", "Process validation shall confirm that the impurity profile for each API is within the limits specified."]</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk_1880..chunk_1882, chunk_1889..chunk_1891, chunk_1895..chunk_1897, chunk_1910..chunk_1912, chunk_1931..chunk_1933, chunk_1937..chunk_1939, chunk_1919..chunk_1921, chunk_1955..chunk_1957, chunk_1964..chunk_1966</data>
      <data key="d11">drugs_and_cosmetics_rules_1945_updated_2024.md</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="api" target="gmp" id="0">
      <data key="d7">REQUIRES_COMPLIANCE</data>
      <data key="d8">13</data>
      <data key="d9">["appropriate GMP as defined in this Part shall be applied to these intermediate or API manufacturing steps.", "Appropriate GMP concepts shall be applied in the production of APIs for use in clinical trials with a suitable mechanism for the approval of each batch.", "A valid manufacturing authorization for the production of APIs should be provided. ... certificate of GMP compliance should be provided.", "...they are manufactured in compliance with WHO current good manufacturing practices (current good manufacturing practices being hereinafter referred to as GMP)...", "The inspections of the manufacturing site(s) are conducted to assess compliance with GMP as recommended by WHO", "The point at which the API starting material is introduced into the manufacturing process is the starting point for the application of GMP requirements.", "certificate of GMP compliance, if available.", "with GMP, good laboratory practices (GLP) and good clinical practices (GCP) of foreign facilities for manufacture of finished pharmaceutical products (FPPs) and APIs", "Verification and confirmation of compliance with GMP by a manufacturer of an FPP or API in a foreign country may be based on the assessment of evidence that includes the report of a recent inspection of the manufacturer by a competent regulatory authority or another internationally recognized organization.", "A desk assessment may be used by an NRA to assess compliance with GMP, GLP and GCP by facilities that manufacture FPPs and APIs.", "This guidance applies to all FPP and API manufacturers (including biologicals and vaccines manufacturers, all sites where APIs are being imported, repackaged or relabelled, and investigational medical product manufacturers), outsourced QCLs, CROs and clinical trial sites that are subjected to GxP inspections in foreign countries.", "GMP certificate from the country of origin: attach a copy of the GMP certificate, if available, in Annex K.", "From this point on, appropriate GMP as defined in this guide should be applied to these intermediate and/or API manufacturing steps."]</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk_1883..chunk_1885, chunk_1991..chunk_1993, chunk_3002..chunk_3004, chunk_4607..chunk_4609, chunk_4682..chunk_4684, chunk_4739..chunk_4741, chunk_4964..chunk_4966, chunk_5423..chunk_5425, chunk_5525..chunk_5527, chunk_5528..chunk_5530, chunk_5531..chunk_5533, chunk_5868..chunk_5870, chunk_7567..chunk_7569</data>
      <data key="d11">drugs_and_cosmetics_rules_1945_updated_2024.md</data>
    </edge>
