    <edge source="api" target="drugs rules 1945" id="0">
      <data key="d7">GOVERNED_BY</data>
      <data key="d8">8</data>
      <data key="d9">["appropriate GMP as defined in this Part shall be applied to these intermediate or API manufacturing steps.", "(iv) making sure that all production deviations are reported and evaluated and that critical deviations are investigated and the conclusions are recorded; ... (2.4.1) In order to verify compliance with the principles of GMP for APIs, regular internal audits shall be performed in accordance with an approved schedule. [chunk_1892]", "(2.5.1) Regular quality reviews of APIs shall be conducted with the objective of verifying the consistency of the process. ... [chunk_1893]", "... quality of the intermediate or API ... shall be cleaned ... (chunk_1907)", "Special transport or storage conditions for an API or intermediate shall be stated on the label. (chunk_1946)", "If necessary, samples of the intermediate or API produced by the modified process can be placed on an accelerated stability programme or can be added to the stability monitoring programme.", "Culture media shall be sterilised before use when appropriate to protect the quality of the API.", "The controls used in the manufacture of APIs for use in clinical trials shall be consistent with the stage of development of the pharmaceutical product incorporating the API."]</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk_1883..chunk_1885, chunk_1892..chunk_1894, chunk_1907..chunk_1909, chunk_1946..chunk_1948, chunk_1973..chunk_1975, chunk_1988..chunk_1990, chunk_1991..chunk_1993</data>
      <data key="d11">drugs_and_cosmetics_rules_1945_updated_2024.md</data>
