      <data key="d8">3</data>
      <data key="d9">["The following requirements apply to the fourth option for submission of API information, where full details are provided in the dossier.", "Confirmation of structure based on e.g. synthetic route and spectral analyses should be provided.", "For APIs that are not described in an officially-recognized pharmacopoeia, the studies carried out to elucidate and/or confirm the chemical structure normally include elemental analysis, infrared (IR), ultraviolet (UV), nuclear magnetic resonance (NMR) and mass spectra (MS) studies."]</data>
