      <data key="d9">["with GMP, good laboratory practices (GLP) and good clinical practices (GCP) of foreign facilities for manufacture of finished pharmaceutical products (FPPs) and APIs", "A desk assessment may be used by an NRA to assess compliance with GMP, GLP and GCP by facilities that manufacture FPPs and APIs.", "This guidance applies to all FPP and API manufacturers (including biologicals and vaccines manufacturers, all sites where APIs are being imported, repackaged or relabelled, and investigational medical product manufacturers), outsourced QCLs, CROs and clinical trial sites that are subjected to GxP inspections in foreign countries."]</data>
