      <data key="d7">STANDARDIZED_UNDER</data>
      <data key="d8">1</data>
      <data key="d9">["The condoms shall be dressed with silicone lubricant. The quantity required on each individual condom should not be less than 200 gm. and the minimum viscosity shall be 200 centistokes. (chunk_2060)"]</data>
