      <data key="d7">GOVERNED_BY</data>
      <data key="d8">1</data>
      <data key="d9">["chunk_8545: In the manufacture of investigational radiopharmaceuticals, the same operator may be qualified as either a production operator or a quality control operator, or both, and the training for a specific function should be documented."]</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk_8545..chunk_8547</data>
