      <data key="d9">["The premises where investigational radiopharmaceutical products are manufactured should be located, designed, constructed and maintained to suit the operations to be carried out.", "chunk_8566: Retention samples from every batch of a particular investigational radiopharmaceutical product should only be collected..."]</data>
