      <data key="d7">STANDARDIZED_UNDER</data>
      <data key="d8">1</data>
      <data key="d9">["Chromatographic methods should be suitable for their intended use. Appropriate acceptance criteria should be specified for parameters such as selectivity (resolution and/or peak-to-valley ratio), sensitivity (signal-to-noise ratio), peak symmetry, repeatability and integration conditions (if applicable). (chunk_9870)"]</data>
